ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋追加20亿美元投资欧洲，并注资四家法国AI初创企业</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Gemini 4 Argon模型，单次输出上限提升至百万Token</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">1400万企业的 AI 同事上线:WorkBuddy 进通讯录，群聊勾选即成任务、产物直接发回企微</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果诉OpenAI窃密案获进展：法院准许调取招聘材料及LINE聊天记录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/34f8ec0f302b1149813b1236ad1a3431.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果诉OpenAI窃取商业秘密案取得关键进展，联邦法官裁定苹果可调取OpenAI招聘相关材料，重点审查OpenAI在面试前接触苹果员工的行为，特别是针对消费硬件与机器人部门的岗位招聘。法院要求OpenAI在5天内提交面试清单、指引、脚本及技术演示等记录，并批准苹果获取OpenAI员工刘畅、彭艾莉莎的LINE私聊记录，同时对上述二人及硬件首席官邓耀谭启动庭外取证。苹果指控前员工利用公司笔记本下载未公开的技术规格、工程演示及专属项目数据，并涉嫌在面试中泄露苹果技术或零部件信息。尽管法官驳回了苹果关于金属表面处理、电源管理等特定研发资料的调取申请，但允许苹果缩小范围后重新递交。此案核心在于OpenAI正研发对标iPhone的消费硬件，苹果试图通过法律手段遏制其在硬件领域的技术窃密与人才挖角行为。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布Apple HomeView等四款智能家居新品，Siri AI全面进驻家庭生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f018c376cd64e0e60bf82308de3ccbfc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司近日举办“欢迎回家”发布会，正式推出四款智能家居新品，全面引入基于Apple Foundation Models构建的Siri AI。核心产品Apple HomeView智能显示屏采用7英寸Liquid Retina屏，支持面部识别与个性化交互，定价299美元，11月13日发售。第二代HomePod mini搭载S10芯片，支持四声道环绕声系统，售价149美元。第四代Apple TV 4K升级A19芯片，CPU与GPU性能分别提升50%及2倍，内置远场麦克风支持Siri AI上下文连续追问。此外，苹果联合LG与施耐德电气推出Apple Home Collection系列，涵盖安防摄像头、智能门锁及温控器，支持UWB技术与原生“家庭”App管理。此次布局标志着苹果通过Siri AI深度整合硬件生态，旨在提</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋追加20亿美元投资欧洲，并注资四家法国AI初创企业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋于10月13日宣布，将在欧洲追加20亿美元投资，此前一年英伟达已在欧洲投入80亿美元。黄仁勋在巴黎访问期间强调“欧洲必须加入AI竞争”，并明确押注开源模型与物理AI。此次投资重点拉拢了四家法国初创企业：医疗预约平台Doctolib、企业AI管理软件商Pigment、化学材料AI研发商Entalpic以及机器人技术公司Genesis AI。英伟达此前已与Mistral AI建立深度合作，为其提供4000颗Grace Blackwell GPU以训练Le Chonk模型。通过资本纽带，英伟达旨在推动欧洲利用开源模型实现技术主权，同时为人形机器人等物理AI领域布局。此举意在通过降低定制成本与提升技术自主性，加速欧洲AI应用落地，并进一步巩固英伟达在欧洲市场的芯片供应地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Gemini 4 Argon模型，单次输出上限提升至百万Token</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2af7948616e4074c69ff40aec3748ff8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind于9月30日推出新一代前沿模型Gemini 4 Argon，核心突破在于将单次输出上限从64K提升至100万Token，旨在解决长周期、复杂工作流的连贯性难题。该模型主攻软件工程、法律、金融及网络安全防御，在DeepSWE v1.1、Vals指数、AutomationBench及LVBench等评测中均表现领先。在网络安全领域，Argon具备自主发现并修补漏洞的能力，CWE-bench v1漏洞修复率达68%。目前该模型采取分阶段发布策略，优先面向可信防御者、开发者及企业用户。定价方面，介绍期每百万输入/输出Token分别为2美元与10美元，后续将调整为4美元与20美元。Google正通过防滥用、防提示注入及强化沙箱等四道防线加固模型安全性，目前已有数千名员工利用其进行代码调试与大</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">1400万企业的 AI 同事上线:WorkBuddy 进通讯录，群聊勾选即成任务、产物直接发回企微</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ad34c1a45a6938ced3df2b91cf663318.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">1400万企业的 AI 同事上线:WorkBuddy 进通讯录，群聊勾选即成任务、产物直接发回企微AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 14, 20263310月14日，腾讯WorkBuddy宣布与企业微信完成深度融合，WorkBuddy客户端现可在企业授权范围内调用消息、文档、会议、微盘等十大能力，并以对话机器人身份进入企业微信通讯录列表，用户可在聊天中直接下达指令。该能力面向已认证企业开放，需将WorkBuddy升级至5.8.0及以上、企业微信升级至5.0.12及以上版本，由管理员在后台统一领用。在具体能力上，WorkBuddy可按「需处理/值得关注/其他」三类归纳企业微信未读消息与未读邮件，并提炼摘要与待办动作。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
